===Etymology===
{{bor+|en|pau|Belau||Palau}}, traditionally derived from {{m|pau|aidebelau||indirect replies}} in reference to the island's creation story, or from {{m|pau|beluu||village}}, from {{der|en|poz-pro|*banua||inhabited land, territory}}.

